Hello Friend! With sadness, we inform you that the fairy world of Mathmagic has been captured by monsters... We are counting on you because only you, with your knowledge and mathematical spells, can deal with them! Level up your hero, learn new abilities, collect artifacts and conquer the forces of evil!

Heroes of Math and Magic is a free educational game for kids. The plot and gameplay covers the basic arithmetic skills, including addition, subtraction, multiplication and division.

The team of developers of kids games Bristar Studio is primarily caring parents. We make sure that your child receives the necessary skills and knowledge in the school curriculum in the most modern way. The kids game, Heroes of Math and Magic, works well as supplemental education or for at-home learning.

Let's face the truth - children love playing games; it's the easiest way to acquire information. That's why, we give the opportunity for small geniuses to enjoy a pleasant game and learn at the same time! This educational game is aimed at schoolchildren; however, adults can also find this game useful for them and fun.

KEY FEATURES:

• Guarantees high involvement in the learning process and improves attention span;
• Your child not only gains theoretical knowledge but also applies it in practice;
• Our game was developed in close cooperation with psychologists and educators;
• Exciting encouragement of the child for solving arithmetic problems;
• The game was based of a school math program;
• Pleasant music and professionally voiced dialogues;
• The game has an official seal from the Ministry of Education;
• Available in English, Ukrainian, Deutsch, Spanish, French;
• Our game is free from cruelty and scenes of violence;
• The ability to customize your character;
• Simple and pleasant graphics for children;
• An interesting and fascinating plot.

HEROES OF MATH AND MAGIC PROMOTES DEVELOPMENT OF:

• Skills in solving arithmetic problems;
• Improves logic;
• Attention span and reaction speed;
• Fine motor skills.

